            <ArticleTitle>A Review of the Landscape of Targeted Immunomodulatory Therapies for Non-Infectious Uveitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s40123-017-0115-5</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Systemic immunomodulatory therapies are the principal means of managing non-infectious uveitis. This review aims to explore the current landscape of systemic uveitis treatments, including biologic therapies and the advent of biosimilar therapies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
